{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/f553a9efa7c37a80632fe46b48250f6b.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/f553a9efa7c37a80632fe46b48250f6b.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Synopsis\u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asahi, the protagonist, is a young man living in the defensive city of Asgard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He inherited his grandmother's restaurant \u201cNorn's Dine\u201d, named after the goddess of \u201cdestiny\u201d, and spends his days as a chef who is well known for his skill and amiable personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is \u201cFate's Table\u201d - the story of Asahi's \u201cdestiny\u201d with the people she meets at Norn's Dine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6About the game\u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/8bc4efe0e92c61f41a36d70477a5d0fb.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/8bc4efe0e92c61f41a36d70477a5d0fb.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=567 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norn's Dine\u201d is an 18-rated BL novel game in which players interact with a variety of unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By selecting the characters who visit the store, the likability level increases and unique episodes are released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you deepen your bond and have more episodes, you will be able to enjoy\u00a0erotic scenes with the person you have become intimate with\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel with 59 original illustrations, and a sizable amount of text. Each route has roughly 8 to 10 \u202fhours of content! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\ufe0eGenitalia are censored with mosaic effects in the Steam release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 The base game includes four routes in total: Frederick, Orfeo, Giulio, and Shidou. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Four additional characters will be added in the future as DLC. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View more details about each character on our official website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b0a2fcd66ebbbda9eb8c529f66cd72d0.avif?t=1772364288\" width=1200 height=676 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Character Introductions\u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>vol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/e256de3dd424738d189f2dbc66cf421e.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/e256de3dd424738d189f2dbc66cf421e.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Frederick\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a35\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u00a0 \u00a0Occupation\uff1aKnight Commander</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a190cm\u3000Weight\uff1a110kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The head of the knights who protect Asgard. Though he can be rather rigid, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his abilities and character make him an exemplary knight. He is the eldest son of a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >noble family, but has a strained relationship with his household.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/d0c45f77b19b910f1ea831c809a904f1.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/d0c45f77b19b910f1ea831c809a904f1.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Orfeo\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a40\u3000Race\uff1aBeastman\uff08Tiger\uff09Occupation\uff1aMafia Boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a203cm\u3000Weight\uff1a150kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss of a mafia faction that controls Asgard from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has a tough appearance, but deep down, he has a heart of gold and is quite fond of children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While highly capable in combat, he is more of a black market mafioso.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/f6f5707564715aa95083db3a794a57b6.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/f6f5707564715aa95083db3a794a57b6.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Shido\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a32\u3000Race\uff1aBeastman\uff08bull\uff09Occupation\uff1aAdventurer\uff08\uff1f\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a199cm\u3000Weight\uff1a125kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious half-beast bull who Asahi found passed out. Due to his amnesia, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he has no recollection of his past. His behavior is often compared to that of a child,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lacking in common sense and moral awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3191b19b9b565911e3df263aa4c14b3c.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3191b19b9b565911e3df263aa4c14b3c.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Giulio\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a24\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u3000Occupation\uff1aAdventurer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a178cm\u3000Weight\uff1a100kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asahi's childhood friend. He\u2019s friendly with everyone and often comes across as frivolous,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but he\u2019s very compassionate. Comes from a tribe of warriors that hold battle in high regard, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and is currently undergoing rigorous training.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Additional DLC Character</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3c89a0a12a48ba7987e4ec39c4354d62.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3c89a0a12a48ba7987e4ec39c4354d62.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Grant\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a36\u3000Race\uff1aDemon\u3000Occupation\uff1aGuildmaster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a188cm\u3000Weight\uff1a95kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The master of the Adventurers' Guild who was a skilled adventurer himself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in his younger days. An old friend of Frederick's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b71380f4de8523392b1549576e0e7d60.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/b71380f4de8523392b1549576e0e7d60.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Rito\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a20\u3000Race\uff1ahalf-beast\uff08Dog\uff09Occupation\uff1aWaiter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a190cm\u3000Weight\uff1a100kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and kind-hearted half-beast whose appaearance resembles a large dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is in charge of cooking and serving the customers at Norn's Dine, always </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wearing a smile and serving as a cheerful mood-maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b333d77d9adae33273ea1d368aa523a1.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/b333d77d9adae33273ea1d368aa523a1.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Lucas\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a28\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u3000Occupation\uff1aAdventurer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a185cm\u3000Weight\uff1a88kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventurer who was taken by Asahi's parents when they were both at a very young age, making them brothers by bond. He's not exactly mute, but he often struggles to express his emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3aeee9e5f191d6606330cf2ed4df3dfc.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3aeee9e5f191d6606330cf2ed4df3dfc.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span>\u3010Laplace\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1aHow old do you think I am?\u3000Race\uff1aIt's a secret!\u3000Occupation\uff1aYou work, you lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a173cm\u3000Weight\uff1a70kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man with a deeply problematic personality who calls himself a bard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He sometimes appears before Asahi, sings some cryptic words, and just as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suddenly, vanishes without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/2f8530c330238b49d9bacf2167337158.apng?t=1772364288\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/2f8530c330238b49d9bacf2167337158.poster.avif?t=1772364288\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>\u2190Murmur</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Sword of Purpose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/74584fd451efbee4048813046e6a821e779461cd.jpg"},{"name":"The Breeze That Aims for the Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/6eab06aa2f8c02f3c57f56b6648f03c369b86a22.jpg"},{"name":"The One Who Obtained Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/7452675e984910d419ef44ca332abd1c691a339c.jpg"},{"name":"The Flower that Blooms at Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/655f7a59ecd6ef007e4f0db4376bb57726ef1f4c.jpg"},{"name":"Gallery Completionist (1)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/0d982d7895774f81f207423c7e261e6b36fc3078.jpg"},{"name":"And Thus, It Ends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/a93dffe846ad839a4dc1c62ac6d4c3f35eaaeae7.jpg"},{"name":"Through the Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/79ce3612be502c391a09009e33459336f9308cf3.jpg"},{"name":"Bearer of the Noble Orlog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/91ec31c6aff1fd5d83dbeea54b5dcbd42ab00617.jpg"},{"name":"Seeker of the Fated Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/f8ff9144acfeb933885cc90ae40bf9343f5ea0fe.jpg"},{"name":"Bound by the Orlog of Longing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664240/08361bb127581ffbe2fe05c61fa512919422b947.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664240?t=1772364288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/7ce41f177b3cb9b202fec4e71b2d809982d76aaf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772364288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/defa9fd01074433dc796721e9daa9ffeaab26cba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772364288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/defa9fd01074433dc796721e9daa9ffeaab26cba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772364288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is an adult-only visual novel containing explicit sexual content, including depictions of sexual violence.\r\nIt is intended exclusively for audiences 18 years and older.\r\n\r\nEXPLICIT SEXUAL CONTENT:\r\n- Contains graphic sexual scenes with clear depiction of nudity and genitalia\r\n- Sexual acts depicted include intercourse, masturbation, and other explicit sexual activities\r\n- Sexual scenes appear occasionally throughout the story as part of narrative progression\r\n- All sexual content is presented in anime/illustrated art style\r\n- Sexual content is non-skippable and integral to the experience\r\n\r\nSEXUAL VIOLENCE - CRITICAL WARNING:\r\nThis game contains depictions of rape and non-consensual sexual acts that are presented in a sexual/fetishized context.\r\nThese scenes are NOT skippable and are part of the main storyline.\r\nThis game is intended as adult fantasy and is NOT appropriate for players who are sensitive to or triggered by depictions of sexual assault.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL MATURE THEMES:\r\n- Prostitution and transactional sexual relationships\r\n- Sexual language, innuendo, and adult humor\r\n- Sexualized character designs and revealing clothing\r\n- Fantasy violence including weapons\r\n- Criminal activity depicted in story\r\n- Dark atmospheric settings\r\n- Depictions of alcohol, tobacco, and drug use\r\n\r\nAll characters depicted in sexual situations are fictional adults (18+).\r\n\r\nCONTENT WARNING:\r\nDue to the nature of the sexual contents, this game may be disturbing to some players.\r\nNo content filters or skip options are available in this game."},"demos":[{"appid":3822410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/f553a9efa7c37a80632fe46b48250f6b.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/f553a9efa7c37a80632fe46b48250f6b.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Synopsis\u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asahi, the protagonist, is a young man living in the defensive city of Asgard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He inherited his grandmother's restaurant \u201cNorn's Dine\u201d, named after the goddess of \u201cdestiny\u201d, and spends his days as a chef who is well known for his skill and amiable personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is \u201cFate's Table\u201d - the story of Asahi's \u201cdestiny\u201d with the people she meets at Norn's Dine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6About the game\u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/8bc4efe0e92c61f41a36d70477a5d0fb.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/8bc4efe0e92c61f41a36d70477a5d0fb.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=567 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norn's Dine\u201d is an 18-rated BL novel game in which players interact with a variety of unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By selecting the characters who visit the store, the likability level increases and unique episodes are released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you deepen your bond and have more episodes, you will be able to enjoy\u00a0erotic scenes with the person you have become intimate with\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel with 59 original illustrations, and a sizable amount of text. Each route has roughly 8 to 10 \u202fhours of content! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\ufe0eGenitalia are censored with mosaic effects in the Steam release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 The base game includes four routes in total: Frederick, Orfeo, Giulio, and Shidou. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Four additional characters will be added in the future as DLC. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View more details about each character on our official website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b0a2fcd66ebbbda9eb8c529f66cd72d0.avif?t=1772364288\" width=1200 height=676 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Character Introductions\u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>vol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/e256de3dd424738d189f2dbc66cf421e.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/e256de3dd424738d189f2dbc66cf421e.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Frederick\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a35\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u00a0 \u00a0Occupation\uff1aKnight Commander</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a190cm\u3000Weight\uff1a110kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The head of the knights who protect Asgard. Though he can be rather rigid, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his abilities and character make him an exemplary knight. He is the eldest son of a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >noble family, but has a strained relationship with his household.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/d0c45f77b19b910f1ea831c809a904f1.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/d0c45f77b19b910f1ea831c809a904f1.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Orfeo\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a40\u3000Race\uff1aBeastman\uff08Tiger\uff09Occupation\uff1aMafia Boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a203cm\u3000Weight\uff1a150kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss of a mafia faction that controls Asgard from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has a tough appearance, but deep down, he has a heart of gold and is quite fond of children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While highly capable in combat, he is more of a black market mafioso.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/f6f5707564715aa95083db3a794a57b6.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/f6f5707564715aa95083db3a794a57b6.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Shido\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a32\u3000Race\uff1aBeastman\uff08bull\uff09Occupation\uff1aAdventurer\uff08\uff1f\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a199cm\u3000Weight\uff1a125kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious half-beast bull who Asahi found passed out. Due to his amnesia, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he has no recollection of his past. His behavior is often compared to that of a child,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lacking in common sense and moral awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3191b19b9b565911e3df263aa4c14b3c.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3191b19b9b565911e3df263aa4c14b3c.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Giulio\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a24\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u3000Occupation\uff1aAdventurer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a178cm\u3000Weight\uff1a100kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asahi's childhood friend. He\u2019s friendly with everyone and often comes across as frivolous,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but he\u2019s very compassionate. Comes from a tribe of warriors that hold battle in high regard, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and is currently undergoing rigorous training.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Additional DLC Character</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3c89a0a12a48ba7987e4ec39c4354d62.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3c89a0a12a48ba7987e4ec39c4354d62.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Grant\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a36\u3000Race\uff1aDemon\u3000Occupation\uff1aGuildmaster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a188cm\u3000Weight\uff1a95kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The master of the Adventurers' Guild who was a skilled adventurer himself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in his younger days. An old friend of Frederick's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b71380f4de8523392b1549576e0e7d60.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/b71380f4de8523392b1549576e0e7d60.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Rito\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a20\u3000Race\uff1ahalf-beast\uff08Dog\uff09Occupation\uff1aWaiter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a190cm\u3000Weight\uff1a100kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and kind-hearted half-beast whose appaearance resembles a large dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is in charge of cooking and serving the customers at Norn's Dine, always </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wearing a smile and serving as a cheerful mood-maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b333d77d9adae33273ea1d368aa523a1.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/b333d77d9adae33273ea1d368aa523a1.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Lucas\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a28\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u3000Occupation\uff1aAdventurer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a185cm\u3000Weight\uff1a88kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventurer who was taken by Asahi's parents when they were both at a very young age, making them brothers by bond. He's not exactly mute, but he often struggles to express his emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3aeee9e5f191d6606330cf2ed4df3dfc.avif?t=1772364288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3aeee9e5f191d6606330cf2ed4df3dfc.avif?t=1772364288 width=800 height=451 /></span>\u3010Laplace\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1aHow old do you think I am?\u3000Race\uff1aIt's a secret!\u3000Occupation\uff1aYou work, you lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a173cm\u3000Weight\uff1a70kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man with a deeply problematic personality who calls himself a bard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He sometimes appears before Asahi, sings some cryptic words, and just as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suddenly, vanishes without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/2f8530c330238b49d9bacf2167337158.apng?t=1772364288\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/2f8530c330238b49d9bacf2167337158.poster.avif?t=1772364288\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>\u2190Murmur</p>","developers":["HIC*"],"dlc":[4335530],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/faefa74a85032c423c5774deb894de770972f937/header.jpg?t=1772364288","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 2.0GHz/Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><s